{"turn_id": "d20-t1", "session_id": "d20", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_feature_layer", "text": "BERT is adopted as a feature extraction layer at the bottom of the multi-head selection framework, replacing BiLSTM.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}]}, {"key": "semantic_enhanced_pretraining", "text": "The authors further optimize BERT by introducing a semantic-enhanced task during BERT pre-training.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}]}, {"key": "enhanced_pretraining_tech", "text": "Enhanced BERT pre-training is listed alongside soft label embedding and NER pre-training as one of the three main technologies introduced to improve performance.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"}]}, {"key": "crf_on_bert", "text": "For named entity recognition, a linear-chain CRF is built on top of BERT, using BERT's output score function at each character as input to the CRF.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-7d1d8e2a3018e917195e868c"}]}, {"key": "cls_global_relation", "text": "An auxiliary sentence-level relation classification task is added, taking the final hidden state of the [CLS] token as a fixed-dimensional pooled representation and feeding it into a multi-sigmoid layer for classification.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-c5debbf64c82a2689eaf8044"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d20-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d20-t2", "session_id": "d20", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_feature_layer", "text": "论文将BERT作为特征提取层放在多头选择框架的底部，用于联合实体-关系抽取。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}]}, {"key": "bert_replaces_bilstm", "text": "在该框架中，BERT被引入作为特征提取层以替代BiLSTM；模型使用BERT为每个字符提取上下文特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}, {"key": "semantic_enhanced_pretraining", "text": "论文通过在BERT预训练期间引入语义增强任务来进一步优化BERT。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}, {"key": "pretraining_optimization_stated_twice", "text": "在相关工作部分，论文将这一改进表述为：用BERT替代BiLSTM作为特征提取层，并通过引入语义增强任务来优化BERT的预训练过程。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}]}, {"key": "conclusion_technologies", "text": "结论部分指出，增强的BERT预训练、软标签嵌入和NER预训练是作者引入以进一步提升性能的三项主要技术。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"}]}, {"key": "bert_background", "text": "论文将BERT描述为使用双向Transformer在大规模无标注语料上预训练、并在其他任务上微调的语言表示模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d20-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
